As a member of both the regional Leadership Team and the Global Legal Leadership Team, this position&nbsp;plays&nbsp;an important role&nbsp;in aligning legal strategy with business priorities and collaborating with senior legal colleagues in other markets to strengthen legal support&nbsp;globally. &nbsp;

